.git
.github
**/.next
**/node_modules
.env
infra/certs
**/.artifacts
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/.next-*
# Session worktrees and tooling (gigabytes in the main checkout), test output.
.claude
**/test-results
**/playwright-report
**/.turbo
# Documentation and operational reports are checked from the checkout, not
# consumed by next build. Keep them from invalidating the source COPY layer.
docs
tasks
# Scraper builds use scraper/ as their own context. Keep backend/ and infra/:
# the rotation worker Dockerfile uses those paths from the root context.
scraper
scripts/build-speed
# Never send local environment/registry credentials in a source COPY.
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/.npmrc
